        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Sixteen leaf-shaped plaques strung on red silk covered with gold wire. The front of each plaque is covered in floral ornament in low relief decorated with turquoises and rock-crystal set over red colouring material to simulate rubies.  The back of each plaque is chased with flowering plants."@en ;
